  "admission": "Only BLS IR66 91-66-A-j26-1 on the two September fixtures, with an existing OEVTP 223_IR crosswalk. Exact directed platform bindings and full-pattern consensus; fill only missing pairs. Kerzers physical platforms 4/6 map to the explicit FOT Kerzers BLS node. A single terminal Bern call on nine pinned original platform records may project within 75 m onto the pinned western BLS source approach, trimming 50–450 m. Remove every other connection at the pattern-local Bern terminal. Preserve all original calls, coordinates, times, permissions and prior paths.",
